  "description": {
   "en": "Ayumi Miyamura came to Mt. Mitake in Okutama, Tokyo to lose weight.\nOn her way to the trailhead, she encounters a strange runner who dashed past her and entered the mountain from a back road. Unbeknownst to her, this was her first encounter with a map and compass, and the start of her quest to participate in an \"adventure race.\"\n\nThis is the start of a next-generation outdoor manga about enjoying nature with all one's being.",
